"name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-02-04T12:35:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T00:03:19Z","closed_at":"2025-03-04T00:03:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.1, 4.3, 4.4 beta1, 4.4 beta2 \n- These are the only versions I tried\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - RTX 4080 - Vulkan, MacOS - M4 - Vulkan\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen baking a VoxelGI node, its results are completely off when an object within its bounds has any form of rotation. For example, consider a wall piece that is symetrical on both sides. The result of the voxel GI bake will be completely different if the wall has a 0 degree y-rotation or a 180 degree y-rotation. Objects that have a 90 degree or -90 degree rotation are even more problematic, since they cannot be rotated in any way to get a correct result:\n\nScreenshots:\nFor all screenshots I set the Display mode in editor to VoxelGI Lighting.\n\nScreenshot 1 - incorrect bake:  \n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e56fe111-b410-4d14-a22f-a492fc9c32c7)\nNotice the left wall is rotated 180 degrees along the y-axis.\n\nScreenshot 2 - correct bake:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3911ea82-d2d3-4987-82ec-771cc7384ae1)\nNotice the left wall now has no rotation at all.\n\nScreenshot 2 - incorrect bake:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4e48840-81ad-4308-a72c-aa1fd40a8245)\nI now duplicated the back wall and rotated it 90 and -90 degrees for the left and right walls.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Setup a scene with some modular pieces\n- Add a light to the scene\n- Add a VoxelGI node to the scene\n- hit bake\n- Now rotate 1 of you walls 180 degrees around the y-axis\n- bake again and notice the different result\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[VoxelGIBakingMRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18657147/VoxelGIBakingMRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102407/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102407/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}